# At the CASE root, one level above the lib-src/ tree the harness parses as the
# library. That is where a real module keeps it: the config sits beside pom.xml or
# build.gradle while the library is supplied as src/main/java below it, so a scan
# rooted at the source tree only sees this file by BUBBLING UP, which is what the
# processor itself does.
lombok.accessors.prefix += m
